title Cassette Bluetooth (T9, synthetic names): the headset's microphone closed on purpose (the list, the Edit page, playback; B29): the recorder keeps its normal view (the cassette in the window, the meter label BT, the meter dark), never the no-input text
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT micclosed
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "BT"
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect notext "The Bluetooth headset is not connected."
expect notext "NO INPUT"
shot rec-micclosed
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
